    "description": "SOME ITEMS CONTAIN AGE/WEAR/DAMAGE/STAINS/DINGS/DENTS\nALL ITEMS SOLD AS IS\nTitle\n: Sheaffer Esterbrook Renew Point Lot Fountain Pens Cartridges Art Supplies\nBrand\n: Sheaffer\nColor\n: Multi-color\nDescription\n: Discover a diverse collection of vintage fountain pens and ink cartridges, ideal for collectors and art enthusiasts alike. This lot includes an assortment of classic writing instruments, many featuring various colored handles, metal nibs, and vintage design elements. Several ink cartridge packs are visible, many branded Sheaffer, and some unopened, adding to the nostalgic value and functionality. The pens and cartridges are housed in a clear plastic storage box for convenient organization and display. These pieces are suitable for creative writing, drawing, calligraphy, or adding to any pen collection. Their mixed materials promise both durability and a touch of retro flair, making them versatile tools for any artist or avid letter writer. Items appear to be in used, vintage condition, with some visible wear and patina consistent with age. All items included are shown in the images for full transparency.\nDezavala\nNotes\nLOCAL PICK-UP IS NOW AVAILABLE.\nPLEASE CONTACT CUSTOMER SERVICE TO SCHEDULE AN APPOINTMENT. YOU MUST MAKE AN APPOINTMENT FOR LOCAL PICK-UP ITEMS. LOCAL PICK-UP IS AVAILABLE MONDAY-FRIDAY 8am-4pm CST\nIF YOU HAVE ANY QUESTIONS PLEASE CONTACT OUR\nCUSTOMER SERVICE DEPARTMENT AT\n(726) 237-7616\nOR CLICK ON THE CUSTOMER SERVICE TAB IN SHOPGOODWILL.COM\nUsed Items Disclaimer\nThis is a pre-owned item and is being sold “AS IS ” If you have any questions concerning this item, feel free to contact us\nAll items (including new) are donated and may pick up dust/debris from warehouse – wash/clean before you wear/use\nWe describe our items to the best of our ability and try to incorporate as much research as possible with books and internet\nHowever, we are NOT experts in any field\nAll measurements for items are approximated\nGoodwill helps change lives\nthrough the power of work!\nThanks for shopping\nGoodwill Industries Of San Antonio!\nTerms of Sale\nOrders must be paid for within ten (10) days from the close of auction, unless other arrangements have been agreed upon.  All orders not paid within ten (10) days from the close of auction will be resold without further notice.",
